:This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy, see [[Gudegude à la mode (Enemy)]].
'''Gudegude Pudding''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that was implemented in [[Version 6.2 Update|Version 6.2]] and can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Gudetama Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 349
|rarity = SR
|name1 = Gudegude Pudding
|name2 = Gudegude à la mode
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Gudegude à la mode''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
This cute duo of pudding and cat aren't all that bad for collab unit standards. You can think of this unit as a weaker version of [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]]. If you have all [[Fruit Treasures|Void Fruit Treasure]], this cat can do 34,000 damage at Lv. 30 using its [[Massive Damage|massive damage ability.]] You could use both this cat and [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] to do some serious damage to [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] enemies. Not a bad unit.

{{Job|Classification = Midranger}}

